{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-1","kind":"proposition","title":"穷竭法引理：反复减半终将小于任意给定量","englishTitle":"Two unequal magnitudes being set out, if from the greater there be subtracted a magnitude greater than its half, and from that which is left a magnitude greater than its half, and if this process be repeated continually, there will be left some magnitude which will be less than the lesser magnitude set out.","book":10,"number":1,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.1","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.1/","group":"prop_1","sourceNumber":1,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-1@raw-8313d9de41fc9aa0","contentId":"euclid-10-1","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8313d9de41fc9aa049b99b4981deb9c059dffdac2c9ef2b4c3d646eda8d632ad","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-1.statement","euclid-10-1.construction.1","euclid-10-1.proof.1","euclid-10-1.construction.2","euclid-10-1.construction.3","euclid-10-1.proof.2","euclid-10-1.proof.3","euclid-10-1.proof.4","euclid-10-1.proof.5","euclid-10-1.proof.6","euclid-10-1.proof.7","euclid-10-1.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-1.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-1","revisionId":"euclid-10-1@raw-8313d9de41fc9aa0","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5a71ab04917a1a1f9e5c5ab44e045bcbe0f03e8433a5c357494838d1300ef4d3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Two unequal magnitudes being set out, if from the greater there be subtracted a magnitude greater than its half, and from that which is left a magnitude greater than its half, and if this process be repeated continually, there will be left some magnitude which will be less than the lesser magnitude set out."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"列出两个不平等的数值,如果从较大的数量中减去一个大于其一半的数值,从剩下的数量中减去一个大于其一半的数值,如果这一过程不断重复,则留下一个低于所列较小数量的数量。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-1.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-1","revisionId":"euclid-10-1@raw-8313d9de41fc9aa0","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3b9e259944324fbfe7f49c27975b719562499279857c77f071fc304425a69949","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB, C be two unequal magnitudes of which AB is the greater: I say that, if from AB there be subtracted a magnitude greater than its half, and from that which is left a magnitude greater than its half, and if this process be repeated continually, there will be left some magnitude which will be less than the magnitude C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AB,C等量为两个不均匀的数值,其中AB等量较大:我说,如果从AB中减去一个大于其一半的数值,从留下的数值大于其一半的数值,如果这一过程不断重复,则留下的数值将低于C等量。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-1.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-1","revisionId":"euclid-10-1@raw-8313d9de41fc9aa0","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b830bec5705f8f4cc75dfd9fe589cbb2cb53c904050fa16cc31d592d15bee374","citations":["euclid-5-def-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For C if multiplied will sometime be greater than AB. [cf. [v. Def. 4](/principles/euclid-5-def-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"乘以C, 可能超过AB [cf. [v. Def. 4](/principles/euclid-5-def-4)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-1.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-1","revisionId":"euclid-10-1@raw-8313d9de41fc9aa0","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7017430b0d44010463ffbb09402a70997041906ac7cbaab025490f1c944d0087","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let it be multiplied, and let DE be a multiple of C, and greater than. AB; let DE be divided into the parts DF, FG, GE equal to C, from AB let there be subtracted BH greater than its half, and, from AH, HK greater than its half, and let this process be repeated continually until the divisions in AB are equal in multitude with the divisions in DE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让它乘DE, 乘以C, 大于AB; 将DE分为DF, FG, GE等同C部分,从AB减BH, 减以其一半,从AH, HK 大于其一半,并让这一进程不断重复,直到AB的分区与DE的分区相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-1.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-10-1","revisionId":"euclid-10-1@raw-8313d9de41fc9aa0","order":4,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ab054226615d4edaf51882f60d7d70948667f1d0ee8f2c68e6a2861d42fec987","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let, then, AK, KH, HB be divisions which are equal in multitude with DF, FG, GE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AK,KH,HB等分数等于DF,FG,GE。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-1.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-1","revisionId":"euclid-10-1@raw-8313d9de41fc9aa0","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"75762fc3b302316388b3d6c1e3515bf4e748d41ca40b1aff2e1f962212cde8cd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since DE is greater than AB, and from DE there has been subtracted EG less than its half, and, from AB, BH greater than its half, therefore the remainder GD is greater than the remainder HA."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,由于DE比AB要多,DE比EG少了一半,AB比一半少了EG,BH比一半多,因此其余GD大于其余HA。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-1.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-1","revisionId":"euclid-10-1@raw-8313d9de41fc9aa0","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5a75012bcb9b694732928a282ba1cf4724da34ca42f2af3cabe457b4902df640","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since GD is greater than HA, and there has been subtracted, from GD, the half GF, and, from HA, HK greater than its half, therefore the remainder DF is greater than the remainder AK."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于GD比HA要高,从GD中减去了一半GF,从HA中减去了HK,HK大于其一半,因此其余DF大于其余的AK。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-1.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-1","revisionId":"euclid-10-1@raw-8313d9de41fc9aa0","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9e4fc5f6c38bf472de1492f4fec1d742c64951cf1bce18cd960927dea4dcf2d5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But DF is equal to C; therefore C is also greater than AK."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但DF等于C,因此C也大于AK。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-1.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-1","revisionId":"euclid-10-1@raw-8313d9de41fc9aa0","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2fced056457ac068c644ec5e6b67c2f73acce51671cc0617959a47db2677711b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore AK is less than C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AK不到C。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-1.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-1","revisionId":"euclid-10-1@raw-8313d9de41fc9aa0","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"69c4219bc36f071fc5e8149a6797d9d28014933b15ee2096f8553b3362e2ead3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore there is left of the magnitude AB the magnitude AK which is less than the lesser magnitude set out, namely C. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AB的星号中剩下AK,低于规定的较小星号,即C,Q,E,D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-1.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-1","revisionId":"euclid-10-1@raw-8313d9de41fc9aa0","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"724fa6d48de96ac2674fbea36091e253d35480274ce8e6e808f904dc90360adb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the theorem can be similarly proved even if the parts subtracted be halves."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"即使减掉的部分减半,也能够同样地证明这些理论。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-1.source","contentId":"euclid-10-1","revisionId":"euclid-10-1@raw-8313d9de41fc9aa0","order":11,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d9c9d9fdb9540a07079c44acf76e28da57c5a14cec6858f77f4b7c1b92046c34","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.1/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.1\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-1:euclid-5-def-4:explicit","sourceContentId":"euc